		{"id":"4939cdc288336a61","type":"text","text":"### 30 Seconds... Game Rules\n\n1. You play in pairs against other pairs \n    \n2. Take turns picking a card and describing the word in English to your teammate.\n    \n3. Do not say the word or use parts of the word.\n    \n4. Do not speak Dutch, point or use gestures.\n    \n5. Your group has 30 seconds to guess the word.\n    \n6. The team who guesses correctly earns two points per answer given.\n7.  If you do speak dutch you gain 1 point per guesed answer","x":591,"y":-234,"width":482,"height":460,"color":"3"},
